---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - Sinewy Electrical Solutions" description="Terms of service for Sinewy Electrical Solutions">
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>TERMS OF SERVICE</h1>
      <p>SERVICE AGREEMENT & TERMS CONDITIONS</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <div class="container" style="max-width: 900px; margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 4rem;">
    <p style="color: var(--text-light); margin-bottom: 2rem;"><strong>Last updated: March 2026</strong></p>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">1. SERVICE AGREEMENT</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        By engaging Sinewy Electrical Solutions for any electrical work or services, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service. We provide professional electrical installation, maintenance, repair, and consultation services in accordance with applicable codes and regulations.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">2. PAYMENT TERMS</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        Invoices are due within 30 days of service completion. A 2% monthly interest charge will apply to overdue accounts. We accept cash, check, credit card, and electronic payment. A 3% convenience fee applies to credit card payments.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">3. PROJECT SCHEDULING</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        Services are scheduled based on availability. For cancellations made with less than 48 hours notice, a service call fee may be charged. Emergency services are available 24/7 with premium rates applying to off-hours calls.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">4. SCOPE OF WORK</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        All work will be performed in accordance with project specifications. Any changes to scope of work must be agreed upon in writing and may affect the project timeline and cost.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">5. WARRANTY</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        We warrant all work for 12 months from completion. Warranty covers defects in workmanship only. Materials manufactured defects are covered under manufacturer warranty.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">6. LIABILITY</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        Our liability is limited to the amount paid for services rendered. We are not responsible for consequential or indirect damages resulting from service delivery.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 3rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem; font-weight: 700;">7. GOVERNING LAW</h2>
      <p style="color: var(--text-dark); line-height: 1.8;">
        These Terms of Service are governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of Bangalore, India.
      </p>
    </section>

    <div class="divider"></div>

    <div style="padding: 2rem; background: var(--light-gray); border-radius: 8px; border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary-orange); margin-top: 2rem;">
      <p style="color: var(--primary-dark); margin-bottom: 1rem;"><strong>Questions about our Terms of Service?</strong></p>
      <p style="color: var(--text-light);">Contact us at <a href="mailto:sinewyeletricalsolutions@gmail.com" style="color: var(--secondary-orange); text-decoration: none;">sinewyeletricalsolutions@gmail.com</a> or call <a href="tel:+918792629665" style="color: var(--secondary-orange); text-decoration: none;">87926 29665</a></p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">4. Liability & Warranties</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        We guarantee our workmanship for one year from the date of service completion. Warranties cover defects in materials and labor only. Equipment warranties are as provided by manufacturers. We are not responsible for any damages beyond our control or resulting from misuse of systems following installation.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">5. Safety & Site Access</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        Clients are responsible for providing safe work conditions and access to project areas. All work is performed in accordance with OSHA standards and local safety regulations. Clients must ensure the work area is clear of hazards and any special requirements are communicated in advance.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">6. Permits & Inspections</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        We handle all necessary permits and coordinate inspections. Permit fees are the responsibility of the client unless otherwise agreed. Work cannot proceed until required permits are obtained and inspections are passed.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">7. Limitation of Liability</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        Our liability is limited to the value of services rendered. We are not responsible for indirect, incidental, or consequential damages. For emergency services, the client is responsible for ensuring proper power isolation and safety precautions.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">8. Dispute Resolution</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        Any disputes shall first be addressed through good-faith negotiation. If unresolved, disputes will be subject to binding arbitration in accordance with law.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section style="margin-bottom: 2rem;">
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">9. Changes to Terms</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        We reserve the right to modify these terms at any time. Continued use of our services constitutes acceptance of any changes.
      </p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 style="color: var(--primary-color); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-size: 1.3rem;">10. Contact</h2>
      <p style="color: #666; line-height: 1.8;">
        For questions regarding these terms, please contact us at info@sinewyelec.com or call +1 (234) 567-890.
      </p>
    </section>
  </div>
</Layout>
